{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20219","headline":"逢江南故昼上人会中郑方回 · 孟郊","name":"逢江南故昼上人会中郑方回","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相逢失意中，万感因语至。\n追思东林日，掩抑北邙泪。\n筐箧有遗文，江山旧清气。\n尘生逍遥注，墨故飞动字。\n荒毁碧涧居，虚无青松位。\n珠沈百泉暗，月死羣象闭。\n永谢平生言，知音岂容易。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20219.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20219","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}